    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later cites that improved mortal Gu recipe when he chooses Time Luck from Fairy Li Shan, planning to spend inch of time instead of lifespan when activating that Immortal Gu. Tai Bai Yun Sheng backs the plan as a time path Gu Immortal who expects the two time path Gu to coordinate.",
